sequenceDiagram
  participant C as RPC client
  participant R as RPC mode
  participant S as Schema registry
  participant P as Pi command
  C->>R: get_command_schema
  R->>S: resolve typed schema
  S-->>R: form or text contract
  R-->>C: schema result
  C->>R: invoke_command
  R->>S: validate arguments and scope
  S->>P: apply validated command
  P-->>R: result or typed error
  R-->>C: invocation response
